  "details": "This has been a bit of an annoying issue as when I join a packed world, I'm immediately lagging because I forgot to change my safety settings. Most people would change their setting right then and there while people are still loading, but this causes most of the avatars to ignore the safety settings update. This causes crashes and extreme lag and is only resolved by reloading the world.",
